<title>HONG KONG: W.I. Carr names group head of research in Asia.</title>
<headline>W.I. Carr names group head of research in Asia.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>W.I. Carr said on Thursday it had appointed Malcolm Brown as group head of research, responsible for the coordination and development of the group's corporate and economic research in Asia.</p>
<p>Brown will join W.I. Carr in early February from Hoare Govett in London where he is the head of British equity research, it said.</p>
<p>Brown will report directly to Nick Harbinson, chief executive of the W.I. Carr Group who is based in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>W.I. Carr is the stockbroking arm of Banque Indosuez.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
